## Changelog

- [Apr 17, 2026](/docs/changelog#form) - `Form` no longer applies default layout classes. Pass `class` for stacked fields, such as `flex w-full flex-col gap-4`. For overlays, wrap the panel and footer in `<Form class="contents">` with the header outside.
